meta {
  name: List Pay Later
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/pay-later?includeCompleted=false
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

params:query {
  includeCompleted: false
}

docs {
  # List Pay Later Records

  Returns all pay-later (credit) records.

  ## Query Parameters

  | Parameter | Type | Default | Description |
  |-----------|------|---------|-------------|
  | includeCompleted | bool | false | Include completed pay-later records |

  ## Response

  ```json
  [
    {
      "id": "guid",
      "invoiceId": "guid",
      "description": "Customer Name",
      "payLaterAmount": 500.00,
      "paidAmount": 200.00,
      "remainingAmount": 300.00,
      "isCompleted": false,
      "createdUtc": "2024-03-01T10:00:00Z"
    }
  ]
  ```

  ## Notes

  - Pay-later is a credit system for trusted customers
  - Customer is identified by the description field
  - `remainingAmount = payLaterAmount - paidAmount`

  ## Authorization

  Requires `reports.view` capability (Manager, Admin).
}
